  + Add New Goal
&lt;/Button&gt;
```

…is **just floating directly inside your `Tabs` block** with no `&lt;TabsContent&gt;` or `&lt;Card&gt;` wrapper around it.

React sees this and screams:  
**“Unexpected token `&lt;div&gt;`” or `&lt;h2&gt;` — this isn&#x27;t valid here!”**

